  "method": "Four fresh fits, two development photos and two pre-existing frozen crop variants each. Identical photo/decoded pixels and fitting settings. Saved automatic masks and observation coverage reproduce the earlier corpus exactly. Previously disputed historical visual coordinates are a diagnostic intervention, not true corners.",
